           resolution did, and unlike the .pdb case (CopyDebugSymbolFilesFromPackages) there's no equally simple
           opt-in switch for this. Not worth chasing further for a file with zero functional impact - dropped
           here rather than the SendGrid.dll/.pdb components above, which are unaffected. -->
