      <!-- Cross-referenced every PackageReference in StoryEditor.csproj/AiChorus.csproj (incl. SharedItems.props)
           against a real output\Release and this file, the same way the Microsoft.Bcl.HashCode/
           System.Collections.Immutable/System.Formats.Nrbf/System.Reflection.Metadata/Keyman10Interop/
           Keyman7Interop components above were added after a real installed-app crash. Verified via decompiling
           both ChorusMergeModule.msm and EC_40_MM.msm that neither merge module bundles any of these - they're
           genuinely uncovered, not just redundant with something already installed some other way.

           First group: the Google Cloud/OpenAI/gRPC AI-translator stack pulled in by SharedItems.props (used
           directly by StoryEditor's EcTranslators-facing code, per that file's own comment) and its own
           transitive Microsoft.Extensions.*/Bcl dependencies - none of it was represented anywhere in this
           installer. -->
